# President Salaheem with its SoA era module (quest rework C3): modules/era/lua/missions/mission_adjustments.lua, whose
# SoA case (RESTRICT_CONTENT 1, ENABLE_SOA 0) replaces Naja's trigger (3020 only when the Timer var is 0 as well) and
# the 73 finish (which sets Timer to 1 until JST midnight). 73, finished: status 1, must zone, Timer 1. A rezone: the
# Timer holds: 3003. A JST day on (the Timer expired): 3020, completed.
module modules/era/lua/missions/mission_adjustments.lua
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/73 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3020
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=40,-6,-30 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau PresidentSalaheem current
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_SOA 0
login
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # status 0: 73
finish                                  # status 1, must zone, Timer 1
rezone                                  # the flag cleared; the Timer holds
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # Timer 1: 3003
finish
wait jst=1                              # the Timer expired
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 3020
finish                                  # completed
